OL,3,AFedEx plane overshoots Miami runway,   
OL,4,Awith flights briefly suspended at      
OL,5,Aairport                                
OL,7,FThe Federal Aviation Administration    
OL,8,F(FAA) has halted flights bound for     
OL,9,FMiami International Airport in Florida 
OL,10,Fafter a FedEx aircraft overran a runway
OL,11,Fon Wednesday evening.                  
OL,13,FDepartures heading to Miami were       
OL,14,Fgrounded just after 20:15 local time   
OL,15,F(01:15 GMT) and all but one runway at  
OL,16,Fthe airport was closed, according to   
OL,17,Fthe FAA advisory. Flights are expected 
OL,18,Fto resume by around 22:00 local time,  
OL,19,Fthe FAA told the BBC.                  
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
