OL,3,AFedEx plane overshoots Miami runway,   
OL,4,Awith flights briefly suspended at      
OL,5,Aairport                                
OL,7,FThe airliner that ran past the runway  
OL,8,Farrived from Memphis. No injuries have 
OL,9,Fbeen reported. The FAA is investigating
OL,10,Fthe incident.                          
OL,12,FThe ground stop comes on the day before
OL,13,FThanksgiving, one of the busiest travel
OL,14,Fdays of the year in the US.            
